{"root":"crossroads_backguard","nodes":{"crossroads_backguard":{"m":"Uh, hello.","r":[["Hello. What's back there?","crossroads_backguard_1",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_1":{"m":"Back there? Oh, nothing.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["But there's a hole in the wall there. Where does it lead?","crossroads_backguard_2",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_10":{"m":"Some other guards went in there earlier, and came back screaming. Enter at your own risk, but don't say I didn't warn you.","r":[["Never mind, I was just kidding.","X",[]],["Here is the gold, now get out of the way.","R",[["inventoryRemove","gold",800,0]]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_2":{"m":"Lead? Oh nowhere. Nothing back there at all.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["There's something you are not telling me.","crossroads_backguard_3",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_3":{"m":"Oh no, no. Nothing interesting here. Move along now.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["How about I pay you 100 gold to move out of the way?","crossroads_backguard_4",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_4":{"m":"You would do that? Hmm, let me think.","r":[["N","crossroads_backguard_5",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_5":{"m":"No.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["200 gold then?","crossroads_backguard_6",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_6":{"m":"No.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["400 gold then?","crossroads_backguard_7",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_7":{"m":"Look, you are not getting back there, and there is nothing to see back there.","r":[["OK, never mind then.","X",[]],["OK, final offer, 800 gold? That's a fortune.","crossroads_backguard_8",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_8":{"m":"Hmm, 800 gold you say? Well, why didn't you say so from the start? Sure, that could work.","r":[["N","crossroads_backguard_9",[]]],"w":[]},"crossroads_backguard_9":{"m":"I should tell you however, that there is something in there that we won't dare go near. I just guard here to make sure it doesn't get